Package: @NAME@-syntax
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: unixfile <unixfile@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @LIBC@), @NAME@ (= @VERSION@)
Section: text
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/unixfile/@NAME@
Description: syntax trees for the code pages of @NAME@
 @NAME@-syntax parses source with tree-sitter and prints its syntax
 tree, which @NAME@ shows as a code page's tree view. It knows Go,
 Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Rust, C, C++, Bash, Java, C#, JSON,
 HTML, CSS and Ruby.
